  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "function": "explanation",
   "scene_type": "zlx_chart",
   "spoken": "After that, the fuel burns only as fast as it mixes with air: the mixing-controlled phase. Finally comes a phase of late burning. The flame now depends on how fast fuel and air meet.",
